WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
I'm a American. You're not going to shut China.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.040
I've got some of the weirdest Chinese AI videos to share with you today.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.840
In these videos, there's always a foreigner breaking the rules,

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.560
and then a Chinese person needs to come along and teach them a lesson.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.000
Now, what do Chinese people actually think of these videos?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.840
Let's take a look at the comments. Some of these are incredible.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.400
Send the foreigners back to their ancestral homelands.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.200
The power of China is unstoppable.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.240
Teach those Americans a lesson.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:37.280
What's interesting is that there seems to be a bit of a generation gap.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.140
The uncles absolutely love this type of content.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.160
They're in every comment section cheering on every AI fight.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.920
I genuinely believe they think these videos are real.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.500
Meanwhile, young people find these videos embarrassing, cringey, and ridiculous.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.540
I love this one.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.780
I love how they're supposedly in India,

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.160
and yet everyone's speaking Chinese with a thick Indian accent.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.320
It seems that there are a few different formats for these videos

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.020
and the Indian ones are quite popular.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.140
This is probably my favourite part of the genre

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:19.200
because it's so far removed from reality.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.980
I've lived in China for years

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.280
and I've never seen foreigners behaving like this.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.700
But in these videos, they're always cutting lines

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.940
making trouble and then getting their comeuppance.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:40.580
And there it is, another valuable lesson delivered by Chinese AI.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.980
Anyway, I hope you enjoyed these videos.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:45.940
Personally, I think they're absolutely ridiculous,

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.880
but I think that's what makes them so funny.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.080
From what I've seen too, Chinese young people know they're fake

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.360
and they think they're silly as well.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.260
And the true fans of the videos tend to be the uncles,

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:00.540
who enjoy it a lot more. That's it for this video. If you enjoyed be sure to give me a like and a

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:05.040
follow and join me next time where I'll be exploring more weird corners of the shinies internet.
